# no-words experiment parameters (evidence/NO-WORDS, docs/one_layer/OMEGESE_MATH.md section 5), frozen before any
# generation. Same harness, prompts and sampling as protocol r3 (PARAMS); what differs: the three arms are
# three spellings of Omegese (omegese = the words, symbols = one non-word token per word and name, numbers =
# word numbers 1..48, names 50..99, values #N; tools/exp445/nowords), the model is the 27B on :18091 (config N),
# and only the 10 public dev tasks are run. run.sh and score.sh read this file through EXP445_PARAMS.
